        "asynchronous_ai_overview": false,
        "markdown": "![Authentic Thai Laab (Larb) Recipe with Pork](https://api.dataforseo.com/cdn/i/07280435-1672-0139-0000-04fc19c72ba8:4)\nLarb ingredients feature `ground meat, toasted rice powder, fresh herbs, and a sharp citrus dressing`.[](https://hot-thai-kitchen.com/laab-moo/) [[1]](https://hot-thai-kitchen.com/laab-moo/)\n\nCore Components\n\n- **Meat:** Ground pork, chicken, turkey, or beef.\n- **Toasted Rice Powder (*Khao Kua*):** Uncooked sticky rice toasted until dark and ground up; the essential nutty signature ingredient.\n- **Dressing:** Fish sauce, fresh lime juice, and dried red chili flakes.\n- **Aromatics & Herbs:** Fresh mint leaves, cilantro (coriander), green onions (scallions), and thinly sliced shallots.\n- **Optional Additions:** A tiny pinch of sugar or palm sugar to balance tartness, Thai basil, or sawtooth coriander (*culantro*).[](https://hot-thai-kitchen.com/laab-moo/) [[1]](https://thai-foodie.com/thaifood/recipe-for-the-perfect-thai-summer-salad-larb/)[[2]](https://www.youtube.com/shorts/m3SxEEQlzGU)\n\nServing Sides\n\n- **Fresh Veggies:** Raw cabbage leaves, crisp lettuce, cucumber slices, and long beans.\n- **Carb:** Traditional sticky rice.[](https://hot-thai-kitchen.com/laab-moo/)",
